{"unit_id":"clarknu__dsh-gateway#card-zh","repo":"clarknu/dsh-gateway","commit":"84bc39a23e15a2a2b65a1f3cb022727590cc5427","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gateway 是面向 DSH Web 的远程访问插件，通过 HTTPS 网关和登录会话保护网页入口，并把请求转发到本机 Web 服务。它接入 DSH 的 webServer 服务，并在设置页提供 Remote Gateway 面板。用户可配置监听地址和端口、管理登录账号、重启或停用网关、查看状态与日志，也可让所有现有会话立即失效。适合需要从局域网其他设备或浏览器远程访问 DSH Web 的用户。需要配置网关登录账号；不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-12","dsh/index.js:21-42","dsh/index.js:452-470","client.js:15-17"]}
{"unit_id":"clarknu__dsh-gateway#card-en","repo":"clarknu/dsh-gateway","commit":"84bc39a23e15a2a2b65a1f3cb022727590cc5427","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-gateway provides HTTPS login access to DSH Web through the webServer service. Its Settings panel manages the listener, accounts, restarts, status, logs, and session revocation. Use it to reach DSH Web from another device. A login account is required; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:9-12","dsh/index.js:21-42","dsh/index.js:452-470","client.js:15-17"]}
